    body: 'Product thinking carried straight into production software: architecture, data, integrations, testing and deployment, by the same team that shaped the product.',
    callout: 'The people who design the software build it. Nothing gets lost in a handoff.',
    wide: true,
    href: '/services/digital-product-engineering',
    linkLabel: 'Digital product engineering',
    items: [
      'Front-end engineering', 'Back-end engineering', 'Full-stack development',
      'Web applications', 'Mobile applications', 'API development', 'Systems integration',
      'Database architecture', 'Authentication and permissions', 'Multi-tenant applications',
      'Payments integration', 'Cloud deployment', 'Automated testing', 'Continuous delivery',
      'Performance optimization', 'Design-system implementation', 'Application modernization',
      'Prototype-to-production development', 'Maintenance and enhancement',
    ],
  },
  {
    n: '04',
    title: 'Accessibility & inclusive design',
    body: 'Accessibility is part of the architecture, built into software from the first component rather than applied as a checklist at the end.',
    href: '/services/accessibility',
