    note: 'Principal experience: founder Britt Midgette led the consolidation of a 6,500-page enterprise ecosystem into a platform of fewer than 1,000 pages, in a director role at a previous agency. That engagement predates Artifact Digital and is not Artifact corporate past performance.',
    href: '/services/enterprise-cms',
    linkLabel: 'Enterprise CMS',
    items: [
      'CMS strategy', 'CMS architecture', 'Enterprise CMS', 'WordPress', 'Headless architecture',
      'Content modeling', 'Content governance', 'Taxonomy', 'Metadata strategy', 'Content migration',
